  "body": "Opening raw files shot with a Canon EOS R5 or R5m2 camera and the \"As Shot\" white balance set, the warning \"temperature or tint out of range\" is shown. Just a warning, no apparent problems on the image nor on the WB. Changing the white balance removes the warning.",
